The design-system package - DESIGN.md, tokens.css, design-tokens.json, the Tailwind bindings, the v2 theme schema, both theme files and the component kit - lives at design-system/ in the repository root rather than under docs/, because tokens.css and the theme YAMLs are build inputs the theme loader reads, not handoff archaeology. The OpenDesign project of the same name is kept as a byte-identical flat mirror for working and previewing; syncing is a plain directory copy in either direction and diff -r is the check. Giving the package a home deliberately did not decide whether the v2 schema replaces the v1 contract - both are tracked and neither is retired.
